      "created_at": "2012-12-21T16:00:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Greetings! There were some people discussing in other threads the conventions which GTG will be officially attending in 2013. Below is a list of all of the large conventions we will be officially attending in 2013.&nbsp;<span>Our current plans are for Sentinels Points to be useable and available at all of these locations, depending on the staffing we have available:</span></p><p>PAX East (Boston)</p><p>Origins (Columbus)</p><p>PAX Australia (Melbourne)</p><p>GaymerCon (San Fransisco)</p><p>Gen Con (Indianapolis)</p><p>PAX Prime (Seattle)</p><p>Essen Spiel (Essen)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For some of those locations, the availability (and useability) of Sentinels Points will depend on how many volunteers we have working in the booths, etc. If you would like to volunteer some time to help out at any of those conventions, send me or Christopher an email and we can let you know what sort of help and committment we're looking for.</p>",
